Z||000014||LoW_KeY||11-28-2001||10:54 PM||||My dad told me he thinks most people are jealous.. hell even my friends dad thinks that and my friend owned one after driving my 84.. he got a 87 GT, 84 coupe, 88 Formula.<P>His dad works at a prison and he over heard a lot of them calling mustangs, camaro's POS too! why because they can't afford them or are threatend that your car is faster.<P>I mean my dads drove my car and had guys in vettes just look over and smile.<P>Hell most chicks are scared of me when I drive my car they think I'm to good for'em or something!! but yeah there's a lot of chicks that dig this car, but I think the majority of the women like the GT more then the coupes..<P>Sure is funny how everyone back home says my car sucks, but I see more and more pop up.  Or better yet when you take someone for a ride (which is rare for me) but they literally almost crap their pants they are like OMG! then they go tell their friends your car was a piece, but you know what they were really thinkin' holy sh!*!!<P>I mean yeah so the fiero had a recall big whoop! no one ever complains about fords (what was that 1.2 million) recall, my ex had a ford probe that thing went up in smoke.<P>Overall I think its jealously, I mean I whaled on a 96 camaro all the way til 90 then backed off.  He was telling me he wasn't flooring it and all that good stuff, but thats why he's goin out and spending all the big bucks on his car.  Little does he know I am too  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>AIM: FierFormula88   <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/kcbanner.jpg"> ||||reg||1
